{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TETHER BRAWL is an action-packed, top-down, 2-player game where co-operation is optional.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE THE ROBOT ONSLAUGHT </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play various game modes, where players tackle relentless robot waves. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From varied arenas to character uniqueness and different enemies, every match is exciting.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand united against the mechanical onslaught, or risk a crushing defeat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/FaceTheRobots.gif?t=1746111147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER YOUR MOVES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every character, from Jeremiah's bat-swinging might to Beccia's sharp throwing, demands skill. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perfectly timing your skills and mastering abilities is essential.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead the charge and dominate the arena with calculated moves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/MasterYourMoves.gif?t=1746111147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRUST IS OPTIONAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CO-OP mode emphasizes teamwork and synergy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The competitive VERSUS mode offers both strategy and betrayal.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense PARTY matches are a balancing act of trust and competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/TrustIsOptional.gif?t=1746111147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAY WITH FRIENDS ONLINE USING STEAM'S REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/RemotePlayTogether-v002.png?t=1746111147\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WISHLIST AND GET READY FOR YOUR MATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/extras/Banner_PixelExpo_v011-SteamPage.jpg?t=1746111147\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2595020?t=1746111147","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746111147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/e3c58160661d2307d273b4a9390ec8f16818a804/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746111147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2595020/e3c58160661d2307d273b4a9390ec8f16818a804/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746111147","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3492290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TETHER BRAWL is an action-packed, top-down, 2-player game where co-operation is optional.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FACE THE RO